      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "Here are a thousand card payments; twenty are fraud. The model flags twenty-five. Fifteen are real fraud: true positives. Ten are honest payments: false alarms. Five frauds slip through as misses. The other nine hundred seventy are correctly cleared. Every payment lands in exactly one cell, and the four counts add back to a thousand.",
