    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "READING RATES",
      "narration_text": "Read across a row for rates about reality. In the fraud row, fifteen of twenty were caught: that is recall, seventy-five percent. Read down a column for rates about the model's claims. Of twenty-five flags, fifteen were right: precision, sixty percent. Across the honest row, ten of nine hundred eighty were wrongly flagged: about one percent.",
